      "content": "Hey, I've been looking over the BioSynthetix files all morning and I'm really excited about this one. The tech looks like a total game changer for the sector. I want to get this Series C lead finalized by Friday. Can you dive into the datasets I sent—the lab results, patents, and burn rates—and give me a high-level summary of the primary risks? I need to make sure our investment thesis is solid before I present it to the committee.",
