      "content": "thanks. regarding the enzymes though—i know they've been bragging about the stability of their core enzyme in the pitch deck. based on the raw lab data in the files, is there anything that might contradict their claims or suggest the stability isn't quite as robust as they're telling us? i just want to make sure we aren't walking into any surprises with the tech.",
